WEBVTT

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.282
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:12.197
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you know that Jake and Toby are cousins?

00:00:12.706 --> 00:00:16.160
<v><b>B:</b></v> I had no idea! Oh well, you live and learn.

00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:18.877
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:19.872 --> 00:00:21.606
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you any good with computers?

00:00:22.086 --> 00:00:26.756
<v><b>B:</b></v> I know how to use one, but I don’t understand the ins and outs of how they work.

00:00:29.054 --> 00:00:29.852
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:32.064
<v><b>A:</b></v> How’s your husband?

00:00:32.776 --> 00:00:36.729
<v><b>B:</b></v> Much better, thanks. He hopes to be up and about by the weekend.

00:00:39.183 --> 00:00:39.908
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:41.048 --> 00:00:42.716
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you sleep well last night?

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:46.066
<v><b>B:</b></v> Not really. I tossed and turned all night.

00:00:48.126 --> 00:00:48.977
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:52.043
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you going to accept that job offer?

00:00:52.454 --> 00:00:56.329
<v><b>B:</b></v> I think I’ll have to. I’m not in a position to pick and choose.

00:00:58.614 --> 00:00:59.438
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:01:00.502 --> 00:01:03.357
<v><b>A:</b></v> What did the people do when the fire started?

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:06.199
<v><b>B:</b></v> They ran back and forth carrying buckets of water.

00:01:08.179 --> 00:01:09.035
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:01:10.134 --> 00:01:12.409
<v><b>A:</b></v> Is your football team top of the league?

00:01:12.955 --> 00:01:18.435
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, but we aren’t home and dry yet, as we’ve got two more matches.

00:01:20.541 --> 00:01:21.266
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:22.307 --> 00:01:24.399
<v><b>A:</b></v> What was the weather like on your walk?

00:01:24.698 --> 00:01:28.486
<v><b>B:</b></v> It was miserable. It rained on and off all day.